Subject: [PATCH 0008] Add a captured-controller one-tic host gate

The step-6 host gate must consume a controller account derived from the real
DEMO1 capture, rather than silently relying on the demo stream.  This is a
host-only adapter for the smallest captured-input validation.  It does not
change the DOOM-EX1 SBF refusal or claim a DCG integration.

